WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.040
Open the existing classroom. Choose the existing room when editing it. Review actual enrollment, assigned staff and the ratio status.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:31.352
Review school, room and age group. Confirm the selected school and room name. Classroom changes affect other role views.

00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:41.784
Review licensed capacity and ratio. Use approved school records for both values. An edited ratio does not establish real staffing compliance.

00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:53.577
Review before saving. In normal use, save once only with authorization, wait for confirmation, then reopen the record. This demonstration stops before saving.

